  <p style="text-indent:5.333%;font-size:10.0pt;margin-top:0.0pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0.0pt;text-align:left;"><span style="background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);color:rgba(0,0,0,1);white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:normal;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;min-width:fit-content;">If an emerging growth company, indicate by check mark if the registrant has elected not to use the extended transition period for complying with any new or revised financial accounting standards provided pursuant to Section 13(a) of the Exchange Act. </span><span style="font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, sans-serif;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_6e707a3e-5619-473d-b077-ada26402026c" contextRef="C_1cd3b9d0-697b-4de2-a127-0233da19fcde" name="dei:EntityExTransitionPeriod" format="ixt-sec:boolballotbox"><span style="background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);color:rgba(0,0,0,1);white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:normal;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, sans-serif;min-width:fit-content;">&#9744;</span></ix:nonNumeric></span></p>
